# Extensionless sibling pages, for gateways that honour _redirects (IPIP-290).
#
# In-app links are spelled docs.html and brand.html, because that is the only
# spelling an IPFS gateway resolves. This file is for the other direction: links
# already handed out by earlier builds, and anything typed or pasted by hand,
# which spell them without the extension. 200 rather than 301 so the address bar
# keeps the tidy form rather than being rewritten to the file.
#
# Only origin-isolated gateways apply this — a path gateway serves the file at
# its name and nothing else — which is why it is a safety net and not the fix.
/docs    /docs.html   200
/docs/   /docs.html   200
/brand   /brand.html  200
/brand/  /brand.html  200
